OL,3,GNEWSAHow Massive Attack's legacy is
OL,4,Achanging festivals
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Massive Attack set the world
OL,7,Frecord for producing the lowest ever
OL,8,Fcarbon emissions at a gig, the duo
OL,9,Fhoped it would create a ripple effect
OL,10,Facross the industry.
OL,12,FAnd this weekend, as 60,000 descend on
OL,13,FBristol for Forwards Festival, their
OL,14,Fdream is being realised. For the first
OL,15,Ftime in the music event's history,
OL,16,Fevery stage will be powered by
OL,17,Frenewable energy.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
