OL,3,GNEWSAHow Massive Attack's legacy is
OL,4,Achanging festivals
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther major events including Love Saves
OL,7,Fthe Day and Bristol International
OL,8,FBalloon Fiesta also swapped diesel
OL,9,Fgenerators for green technology this
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FMassive Attack's Robert Del Naja said
OL,13,Ftheir 2024 show was always about
OL,14,Fsystemic change, adding it was
OL,15,Fgratifying to see this permanent legacy
OL,16,Fof decarbonisation for festivals.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
